{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0FFJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\Mor(Z' \\otimes X, Z) \\to\n\\Mor(Z' \\otimes X \\otimes Y, Z \\otimes Y) \\to\n\\Mor(Z', Z \\otimes Y)\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$\\eta$", "MATH_0003": "$$\n\\Mor(Z', Z \\otimes Y) \\to\n\\Mor(Z' \\otimes X, Z \\otimes Y \\otimes X) \\to\n\\Mor(Z' \\otimes X, Z)\n$$", "MATH_0004": "$\\epsilon$", "MATH_0005": "$a : Z' \\to Z \\otimes Y$", "MATH_0006": "$$\nZ' \\xrightarrow{\\text{id}_{Z'} \\otimes \\eta}\nZ' \\otimes X \\otimes Y \\xrightarrow{a \\otimes \\text{id}_{X \\otimes Y}}\nZ \\otimes Y \\otimes X \\otimes Y\n\\xrightarrow{\\text{id}_Z \\otimes \\epsilon \\otimes \\text{id}_Y}\nZ \\otimes Y\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$a$", "MATH_0008": "$(\\text{id}_{Z \\otimes Y} \\otimes \\eta) \\circ a :\nZ' \\to Z \\otimes Y \\to Z \\otimes Y \\otimes X \\otimes Y$", "MATH_0009": "$\\text{id}_{Z \\otimes Y} \\otimes \\eta$", "MATH_0010": "$\\text{id}_Z \\otimes \\epsilon \\otimes \\text{id}_Y$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:afcec3b493bea27beea7354b322a9ef99bdec6dd4eff0641772dec4c4cc6d35a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1c7bf899591ba4e834b95cffd932d128fa06b5c09aae36b6a56d46a4cdef22ee", "source_text": "Consider the maps\n<MATH_0001>\nwhere we use <MATH_0002> in the second arrow\nand the sequence of maps\n<MATH_0003>\nwhere we use <MATH_0004> in the second arrow.\nTo show these arrows are mutually inverse, consider a map\n<MATH_0005>. We have to show that\n<MATH_0006>\nis equal to <MATH_0007>. The composition of the first two arrows equals\n<MATH_0008>.\nThen the composition of <MATH_0009>\nand <MATH_0010> equals\nthe identity by definition of the dual. Similarly for the other\ncomposition. We omit the proof of the second equality.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9dac67ce018d09174b410b7e902636400eeb25de5e6018f2b224615c05ef9773", "unit_id": "tag:0FFQ:proof"}
